    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dOedo Developer\u201d is a city building simulation game that is based in the Edo era of Japan. Set foot along side Ieyasu Tokugawa into the barren lands of the Edo region, and experience the process of it expanding to a bustling metropolis of a million residents. Story mode offers a history based city building experience, and in free play mode, you will be free to build up the city of Edo of your dreams. You will also have access to an external Wiki, where you can learn about the economic and social structures as you play through the game. This game also recreates the boat based distribution structure that helped construct the life styles of the Edo people. Grasp what went on in the past as you aid in shaping the bright future of Edo.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dOedo Developer\u201d is a city building simulation game that is based in the Edo era of Japan. Set foot along side Ieyasu Tokugawa into the barren lands of the Edo region, and experience the process of it expanding to a bustling metropolis of a million residents. Story mode offers a history based city building experience, and in free play mode, you will be free to build up the city of Edo of your dreams. You will also have access to an external Wiki, where you can learn about the economic and social structures as you play through the game. This game also recreates the boat based distribution structure that helped construct the life styles of the Edo people. Grasp what went on in the past as you aid in shaping the bright future of Edo.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cOedo Developer\u201d is a city builder featuring Ieyasu Tokugawa's Edo. Story and free play modes are available, the first offering a history based city building experience, and the second allowing you to freely develop the lands. Plan, build, distribute, and learn as you make the Edo of your dreams!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese",
